1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,096
Norse Atlantic's Norwegian airline

2
00:00:02,096 --> 00:00:03,563
has filed for bankruptcy.

3
00:00:04,013 --> 00:00:05,606
The filing came on Friday,

4
00:00:05,606 --> 00:00:08,179
one day after Norse grounded every flight.

5
00:00:08,179 --> 00:00:09,772
All flights are cancelled,

6
00:00:09,772 --> 00:00:11,610
and ticket sales have stopped.

7
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:14,603
The board filed at the Agder District Court

8
00:00:14,603 --> 00:00:16,851
in southern Norway, near the airline's

9
00:00:16,851 --> 00:00:18,270
headquarters in Arendal.

10
00:00:18,270 --> 00:00:20,162
A trustee will now be appointed.

11
00:00:20,612 --> 00:00:22,587
Chief executive Eivind Roald said

12
00:00:22,587 --> 00:00:24,203
the company is deeply sorry

13
00:00:24,203 --> 00:00:26,177
for the impact on its passengers,

14
00:00:26,177 --> 00:00:27,554
employees and partners.

15
00:00:28,004 --> 00:00:30,512
Passengers should not go to the airport.

16
00:00:30,512 --> 00:00:32,645
Contact your travel agent, insurer

17
00:00:32,645 --> 00:00:34,589
or card provider about refunds.

18
00:00:35,039 --> 00:00:37,001
Norse's customer service by phone,

19
00:00:37,001 --> 00:00:39,195
email and chat is no longer available,

20
00:00:39,195 --> 00:00:40,868
so check your booking through

21
00:00:40,868 --> 00:00:43,350
the airline's website or your travel agent.

22
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:45,578
Its UK sister airline has also

23
00:00:45,578 --> 00:00:48,364
cancelled all flights, while the parent company

24
00:00:48,364 --> 00:00:49,549
looks for a solution

25
00:00:49,549 --> 00:00:51,267
for the rest of the business.

26
00:00:51,717 --> 00:00:53,290
Norse was founded in 2021

27
00:00:53,290 --> 00:00:56,371
to bring back budget flights across the Atlantic.

28
00:00:56,371 --> 00:00:59,263
Soaring fuel costs and a lack of fresh funding

29
00:00:59,263 --> 00:01:01,150
left it without a way forward.

30
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:03,294
Want more stories like this?

31
00:01:03,294 --> 00:01:04,988
Follow Aviation Facts Daily.
